          <msContents>
            <summary>Grabadin medicinarum parti cularium. Written in a neat semi gohic hand, 30-37 lines to a page. Initials, paragraph marks, and some headings in red. Fol. 1 IN nomine dei misericordis iohannis nacatem filii me/suhe grabadin medicinarum particularium incipitur ... 131v ...virtuem auem cordis/comforare non negligas. deo gracias.//Finitus feria quarta post Iudica per me Iohannem lindner/de wasser wurga Anno domini. 1418. [23 March 1418.].</summary>
